ous attitude and a confident personality.\n\nI don't have a strong idea for an image. Can I leave the specifics to you? I'll leave NSFW on for the sake of artistic freedom.\n\nI apologize, as some of the references are nsfw...\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ak6ftjhw-9PuhSUvyEp7770P56Bz0CoC?usp=sharing\n\nThank you for your consideration.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@AoyuzuAoyuzu/works/149", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1ba8e745/uploads/origins/93da27a0-c1dc-4cba-81dc-3b705a12ae4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=569465ccefc00113a590333cdd752250", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1ba8e745/uploads/origins/93da27a0-c1dc-4cba-81dc-3b705a12ae4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=569465ccefc00113a590333cdd752250, https://si.imgix.net/1ba8e745/uploads/origins/93da27a0-c1dc-4cba-81dc-3b705a12ae4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=44765eb4980973bfa93a6f2a545018dc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1ba8e745/uploads/origins/93da27a0-c1dc-4cba-81dc-3b705a12ae4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d0c8de51dfd407f39f10ebd28d443a5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは！ご依頼ありがとうございます！別のイラストを依頼したいです。彼女は日焼けした肌の狐娘で、頭にスライムが付いていて、尾もスライムで覆われています。スライムは様々な物体や形を作り出せ、彼女自身も体の一部をスライムに変形させられます！普段はクールですが、すぐに恥ずかしがります。\n\n姿はスライム化部分または全身スライム化でお願いします。ポーズや細部はご自由にお任せします。NSFW設定も可能です！ご検討ありがとうございます。https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1eTG5UOn0QEcpLyvgbHj3isFf8OXzyA-B", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@AoyuzuAoyuzu/works/148", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1bb2ede8/uploads/origins/8c2ad507-8a7f-4f48-88a8-fd3657a1e06c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a78e4414ded50c28cbd4b9f2a4859f01", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1bb2ede8/uploads/origins/8c2ad507-8a7f-4f48-88a8-fd3657a1e06c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&f